+trace_record_types={'event_msg': 117, 'response_item': 277, 'session_meta': 1, 'turn_context': 1, 'world_state': 1}
+trace_payload_types={'None': 3, 'agent_message': 9, 'custom_tool_call': 83, 'custom_tool_call_output': 83, 'function_call': 4, 'function_call_output': 4, 'message': 14, 'patch_apply_end': 17, 'reasoning': 89, 'task_complete': 1, 'task_started': 1, 'token_count': 88, 'user_message': 1}
+runtime-metrics.json=absent (allowed for legacy-selected-stage1; historical metric not reconstructed)
+
+ADDITIONAL READ-ONLY COMMANDS
+sha256sum /audit-campaign-lock.json /reference/canonical.py /reference/prompt.py \
+  /reference/py2mpy.py /candidate/prompt.py /candidate/py2mpy.py /run.json \
+  /task.json /generation-result.json /generation-evidence/invocation.json \
+  /generation-evidence/metrics.json /generation-evidence/usage.json \
+  /generation-evidence/codex-last.txt /generation-evidence/codex-output.log \
+  /generation-evidence/prompt.txt \
+  /generation-evidence/codex-trace/2026/07/22/rollout-2026-07-22T21-13-06-019f8cbf-79b7-7571-b6ad-5449cf299015.jsonl
+cmp -s /candidate/prompt.py /reference/prompt.py
+cmp -s /candidate/py2mpy.py /reference/py2mpy.py
+diff -r --no-dereference /candidate/reference-semantics /reference/reference-semantics
+find /candidate /reference /generation-evidence/codex-trace \
+  \( -type l -o -not \( -type f -o -type d \) \) -printf '%y %p -> %l\n'
+kompile --version
+kprove --version
+
+ADDITIONAL RESULTS
+All four identity/special-entry commands exited 0 with no differences or
+special entries. Both K commands reported v7.1.293, matching the campaign lock.
+The exact standard file hashes are checked by check_provenance.py above.
