+SCRATCH PREPARATION
+Only source artifacts were copied. The supplied semantics came from
+/reference/reference-semantics, not from candidate-built output. Candidate
+verification/spec/program sources were copied separately. No *-kompiled
+directory existed before these commands.
+
+COMMAND 1
