+Residual result:
+  <k> str(S) ~> .K </k>
+Unmet equality includes:
+  S #Equals seqConcat(S, revISAcc(prefixIS(S, I), .IntSeq))
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further.
+executed_loop_body_mutant_exit=1
+
+GROUND RESULT SUBSTITUTION
+
+COMMAND
