+
+BRIDGE-FREE GROUND SLICE WITNESSES
+
+COMMAND
+kprove spec-slice-ground.k \
+  --definition audit-connection-kompiled \
+  --spec-module SPEC-SLICE-GROUND
+
+EXIT STATUS
+0
+
+BOUNDED OUTPUT
