Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The claims rebuild to `#Top` and are non-vacuous, but no claim executes `make_palindrome` from entry. Replacing the purportedly pinned full closure with `return "WRONG"` leaves the loop proof at `#Top`, proving that closure is unused environment data.

Detailed findings: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Reproducible artifacts: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/)
